---
// Aether Product Tiers: Particle, Wave, Matter
---

<section id='pricing' class='py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-dark-900 to-dark-950'>
  <div class='mx-auto max-w-7xl'>
    <div class='mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center mb-16'>
      <h2 class='gsap-fadein text-base font-semibold text-red-400 mb-4'>
        <i class='fa-solid fa-layer-group text-red-400 mr-2' aria-hidden='true'></i>
        Drei Ebenen der Realität
      </h2>
      <p class='gsap-fadein text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6' style='animation-delay: 0.15s'>
        Von flüchtig bis <span class='text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-red-400 to-rose-500'>manifestiert</span>
      </p>
      <p class='gsap-fadein text-xl text-light-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto' style='animation-delay: 0.3s'>
        Wähle die Ebene, die zu deinem Workflow passt. Von kurzlebigen Shares bis zu langfristigen Archiven.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class='grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8'>
      <!-- Particle (Free) -->
      <div class='gsap-fadein relative bg-dark-900/50 border border-red-500/20 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-red-500/40 transition-all group' style='animation-delay: 0.45s'>
        <!-- Pulsing Particle Animation -->
        <div class='absolute top-6 right-6 w-3 h-3 bg-red-400 rounded-full animate-pulse' aria-hidden='true'></div>
        
        <div class='mb-6'>
          <h3 class='text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2'>Particle</h3>
          <p class='text-light-400 mb-4'>Für den flüchtigen Moment.</p>
          <div class='flex items-baseline gap-2'>
            <span class='text-4xl font-bold text-white'>Kostenlos</span>
          </div>
          <p class='text-sm text-light-500 mt-2'>Keine Anmeldung erforderlich</p>
        </div>

        <p class='text-light-300 mb-6 italic'>"Für den schnellen Funken."</p>

        <ul class='space-y-3 mb-8' role='list'>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-sparkles text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>Bis zu <strong class='text-white'>100 MB</strong> pro Upload</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-clock text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'><strong class='text-white'>24 Stunden</strong> Auto-Burn</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-link text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'><strong class='text-white'>1 Einweg-Link</strong></span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>TLS Transportverschlüsselung</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-euro-sign text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>Keine Anmeldung</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <a 
          href='https://aether.waldheim.dev' 
          class='gsap-btn block w-full text-center px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-dark-800 border border-red-500/30 text-white font-semibold hover:border-red-500/50 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-red-500/30 transition-all'
          aria-label='Particle kostenlos starten'
        >
          Kostenlos starten
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Wave (Standard) -->
      <div class='gsap-fadein relative bg-gradient-to-br from-red-900/20 to-rose-900/20 border-2 border-red-500/50 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg shadow-red-500/20 group' style='animation-delay: 0.6s'>
        <!-- Badge -->
        <div class='absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-4 py-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 to-rose-600 rounded-full'>
          <span class='text-white text-sm font-bold'>Beliebt</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Wave Animation Background -->
        <svg class='absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-24 opacity-10' viewBox='0 0 1200 120' preserveAspectRatio='none' aria-hidden='true'>
          <path d='M321.39,56.44c58-10.79,114.16-30.13,172-41.86,82.39-16.72,168.19-17.73,250.45-.39C823.78,31,906.67,72,985.66,92.83c70.05,18.48,146.53,26.09,214.34,3V0H0V27.35A600.21,600.21,0,0,0,321.39,56.44Z' class='fill-red-500/20'></path>
        </svg>

        <div class='mb-6 relative z-10'>
          <h3 class='text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2'>Wave</h3>
          <p class='text-light-300 mb-4'>Fließend und anpassbar.</p>
          <div class='flex items-baseline gap-2'>
            <span class='text-4xl font-bold text-white'>€8</span>
            <span class='text-light-400'>/Monat</span>
          </div>
          <p class='text-sm text-red-400 mt-2 font-semibold'>Monatlich kündbar</p>
        </div>

        <p class='text-light-200 mb-6 italic'>"Bringe deine Projekte in den Fluss."</p>

        <ul class='space-y-3 mb-8 relative z-10' role='list'>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-database text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>Bis zu <strong class='text-white'>5 GB</strong> pro Datei</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-calendar-days text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'><strong class='text-white'>30 Tage</strong> Speicherzeit</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-shuffle text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>Bis zu <strong class='text-white'>10 Links</strong> pro Datei</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-lock text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>Passwortschutz & Link-Widerruf</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-chart-line text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>Multi-Link-Management</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-headset text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>E-Mail Support</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <a 
          href='https://portal.waldheim.dev' 
          target='_blank'
          rel='noopener noreferrer'
          class='gsap-btn block w-full text-center px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 to-rose-600 text-white font-semibold hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-red-500/50 transition-all'
          aria-label='Wave für 8 Euro pro Monat abonnieren'
        >
          Jetzt für €8/Monat
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Matter (Pro) -->
      <div class='gsap-fadein relative bg-dark-900/50 border border-red-500/20 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-red-500/40 transition-all group' style='animation-delay: 0.75s'>
        <!-- Crystal/Cube Decoration -->
        <div class='absolute top-6 right-6 w-10 h-10 border-2 border-red-500/50 rotate-45 animate-pulse' style='animation-duration: 3s' aria-hidden='true'></div>

        <div class='mb-6'>
          <h3 class='text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2'>Matter</h3>
          <p class='text-light-400 mb-4'>Daten werden zur Realität.</p>
          <div class='flex items-baseline gap-2'>
            <span class='text-4xl font-bold text-white'>€24</span>
            <span class='text-light-400'>/Monat</span>
          </div>
          <p class='text-sm text-light-500 mt-2'>Für Heavy-User & Teams</p>
        </div>

        <p class='text-light-300 mb-6 italic'>"Manifestiere deine Arbeit."</p>

        <ul class='space-y-3 mb-8' role='list'>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-building text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>Bis zu <strong class='text-white'>50 GB</strong> pro Datei</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-shield-check text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'><strong class='text-white'>1 Jahr</strong> garantierte Retention</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-diagram-project text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>Bis zu <strong class='text-white'>50 Links</strong> pro Datei</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-fingerprint text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>Langzeit-Integritätsschutz</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-star text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>Premium Support</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-code text-red-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class='text-light-300'>API-Zugriff (Q1 2026)</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <a 
          href='https://portal.waldheim.dev' 
          target='_blank'
          rel='noopener noreferrer'
          class='gsap-btn block w-full text-center px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-dark-800 border border-red-500/30 text-white font-semibold hover:border-red-500/50 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-red-500/30 transition-all'
          aria-label='Matter für 24 Euro pro Monat abonnieren'
        >
          Jetzt für €24/Monat
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pricing Comparison Note -->
    <div class='gsap-fadein mt-12 text-center text-light-400' style='animation-delay: 0.9s'>
      <p class='text-sm'>
        Alle Preise verstehen sich zzgl. MwSt. • Monatlich kündbar • Kein Vendor Lock-in
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
